{"id":"U07","title":"The Door and the Window","titleZh":"门与窗","paras":[{"id":"U07-P1","sentences":[{"id":"U07-P1-S1","hard":false,"text":"Since our twins began learning to walk, my wife and I have kept telling them that our sliding glass door is just a window."},{"id":"U07-P1-S2","hard":false,"text":"The reason is obvious."},{"id":"U07-P1-S3","hard":false,"text":"If we admit it is a door, they'll want to go outside constantly."},{"id":"U07-P1-S4","hard":false,"text":"It will drive us crazy."},{"id":"U07-P1-S5","hard":false,"text":"The kids apparently know the truth."},{"id":"U07-P1-S6","hard":true,"text":"But our insisting it's merely a window has kept them from attempting millions of requests to open the door."}],"zh":"自从我们的双胞胎开始学走路以来，我和妻子就一直告诉他们，我们的滑动玻璃门只是一扇窗户。原因很简单。如果我们承认它是一扇门，他们就会一直想出去。这会让我们发疯。孩子们显然知道真相。但我们坚持说它仅仅是一扇窗户，这阻止了他们无数次要求打开门的尝试。"},{"id":"U07-P2","sentences":[{"id":"U07-P2-S1","hard":false,"text":"I hate lying to the kids."},{"id":"U07-P2-S2","hard":true,"text":"One day they'll wake up and discover that everything they've always known about windows is a lie."}],"zh":"我讨厌对孩子们撒谎。总有一天他们会醒悟过来，发现他们一直以来所知道的关于窗户的一切都是谎言。"},{"id":"U07-P3","sentences":[{"id":"U07-P3-S1","hard":false,"text":"I wonder if parents should always tell the truth no matter the consequences."},{"id":"U07-P3-S2","hard":true,"text":"I have a very strong fear that the lie we're telling is doing spiritual damage to our children."},{"id":"U07-P3-S3","hard":false,"text":"Windows and doors have important metaphorical meanings."},{"id":"U07-P3-S4","hard":false,"text":"I'm telling them they can't open what they absolutely know is a door."},{"id":"U07-P3-S5","hard":false,"text":"What if later in life they come to a metaphorical door, like an opportunity of some sort, and instead of opening the door and taking the opportunity, they just stare at it and wonder, \"What if it isn't a door?\""},{"id":"U07-P3-S6","hard":false,"text":"That is, \"What if it isn't a real opportunity?\""}],"zh":"我想知道父母是否应该无论后果如何都始终说实话。我非常担心我们正在说的谎言正在对我们的孩子造成精神上的伤害。窗户和门有着重要的隐喻意义。我告诉他们不能打开他们绝对知道是一扇门的东西。如果将来在生活中他们遇到一扇隐喻的门，比如某种机会，他们不是打开门抓住机会，而只是盯着它想，\"如果它不是一扇门呢？\"也就是说，\"如果它不是一个真正的机会呢？\""},{"id":"U07-P4","sentences":[{"id":"U07-P4-S1","hard":false,"text":"Maybe it's an unreasonable fear."},{"id":"U07-P4-S2","hard":true,"text":"But the bottom line is that I shouldn't lie to my kids."},{"id":"U07-P4-S3","hard":false,"text":"I should just accept repeatedly having to say, \"No. We can't go outside now.\""},{"id":"U07-P4-S4","hard":false,"text":"Then when they come to other doors in life, be they real or metaphorical, they won't hesitate to open them and walk through."}],"zh":"也许这是一种不合理的恐惧。但底线是我不应该对我的孩子撒谎。我应该接受不得不反复说\"不，我们现在不能出去\"的事实。这样，当他们在生活中遇到其他的门时，无论是真实的还是隐喻的，他们都会毫不犹豫地打开并走过去。"}],"words":[{"id":"U07-W01","lemma":"twin","surface":"twins","pos":"n.","zh":"双胞胎","sent":"U07-P1-S1","phrases":[{"en":"identical twins","zh":"同卵双胞胎"}]},{"id":"U07-W02","lemma":"keep","surface":"kept","pos":"v.","zh":"保持; 持续","sent":"U07-P1-S1","phrases":[{"en":"keep doing sth.","zh":"持续做某事"},{"en":"keep from","zh":"阻止; 抑制"}]},{"id":"U07-W03","lemma":"slide","surface":"sliding","pos":"v. / adj.","zh":"v. 滑动; 滑行 adj. 滑动的","sent":"U07-P1-S1","phrases":[{"en":"sliding door","zh":"滑动门"},{"en":"slide down","zh":"滑下"}]},{"id":"U07-W04","lemma":"obvious","surface":"obvious","pos":"adj.","zh":"明显的; 显而易见的","sent":"U07-P1-S2","phrases":[{"en":"the reason is obvious","zh":"原因很简单"},{"en":"it is obvious that","zh":"显然..."}]},{"id":"U07-W05","lemma":"admit","surface":"admit","pos":"v.","zh":"承认; 准许进入","sent":"U07-P1-S3","phrases":[{"en":"admit to","zh":"承认..."},{"en":"admit defeat","zh":"认输"}]},{"id":"U07-W06","lemma":"constantly","surface":"constantly","pos":"adv.","zh":"不断地; 经常地","sent":"U07-P1-S3","phrases":[{"en":"constantly want","zh":"一直想要"}]},{"id":"U07-W07","lemma":"drive","surface":"drive","pos":"v. / n.","zh":"v. 驱使; 驾驶 n. 驱动力; 驾驶","sent":"U07-P1-S4","phrases":[{"en":"drive sb. crazy","zh":"使某人发疯"},{"en":"drive away","zh":"赶走; 驶离"}]},{"id":"U07-W08","lemma":"apparently","surface":"apparently","pos":"adv.","zh":"显然; 似乎","sent":"U07-P1-S5","phrases":[{"en":"apparently know","zh":"显然知道"}]},{"id":"U07-W09","lemma":"insist","surface":"insisting","pos":"v.","zh":"坚持; 坚决认为","sent":"U07-P1-S6","phrases":[{"en":"insist on","zh":"坚持..."},{"en":"insist that","zh":"坚持认为..."}]},{"id":"U07-W10","lemma":"merely","surface":"merely","pos":"adv.","zh":"仅仅; 只不过","sent":"U07-P1-S6","phrases":[{"en":"merely a window","zh":"仅仅是一扇窗户"}]},{"id":"U07-W11","lemma":"keep from","surface":"kept them from attempting","pos":"phr. v.","zh":"阻止; 使免于","sent":"U07-P1-S6","phrases":[{"en":"keep sb. from doing sth.","zh":"阻止某人做某事"}]},{"id":"U07-W12","lemma":"request","surface":"requests","pos":"n. / v.","zh":"n. 请求; 要求 v. 请求; 要求","sent":"U07-P1-S6","phrases":[{"en":"make a request","zh":"提出请求"},{"en":"at the request of","zh":"应...的要求"}]},{"id":"U07-W13","lemma":"lie","surface":"lying","pos":"v.","zh":"撒谎; 躺; 位于","sent":"U07-P2-S1","phrases":[{"en":"lie to sb.","zh":"对某人撒谎"},{"en":"tell a lie","zh":"说谎"}]},{"id":"U07-W14","lemma":"discover","surface":"discover","pos":"v.","zh":"发现; 发觉","sent":"U07-P2-S2","phrases":[{"en":"discover the truth","zh":"发现真相"},{"en":"discover that","zh":"发现..."}]},{"id":"U07-W15","lemma":"wonder","surface":"wonder","pos":"v. / n.","zh":"v. 想知道; 疑惑 n. 奇迹; 惊奇","sent":"U07-P3-S1","phrases":[{"en":"wonder if","zh":"想知道是否..."},{"en":"no wonder","zh":"难怪"}]},{"id":"U07-W16","lemma":"consequence","surface":"consequences","pos":"n.","zh":"后果; 结果","sent":"U07-P3-S1","phrases":[{"en":"no matter the consequences","zh":"无论后果如何"},{"en":"face the consequences","zh":"承担后果"}]},{"id":"U07-W17","lemma":"fear","surface":"fear","pos":"n. / v.","zh":"n. 恐惧; 担心 v. 害怕; 担心","sent":"U07-P3-S2","phrases":[{"en":"have a fear that","zh":"担心..."},{"en":"for fear of","zh":"唯恐; 以免"}]},{"id":"U07-W18","lemma":"tell a lie","surface":"the lie we're telling","pos":"phr.","zh":"撒谎; 说谎","sent":"U07-P3-S2","phrases":[{"en":"tell a lie","zh":"说谎"}]},{"id":"U07-W19","lemma":"spiritual","surface":"spiritual","pos":"adj.","zh":"精神的; 心灵的","sent":"U07-P3-S2","phrases":[{"en":"spiritual damage","zh":"精神伤害"},{"en":"spiritual life","zh":"精神生活"}]},{"id":"U07-W20","lemma":"damage","surface":"damage","pos":"n. / v.","zh":"n. 伤害; 损害 v. 损害; 毁坏","sent":"U07-P3-S2","phrases":[{"en":"do damage to","zh":"对...造成伤害"},{"en":"cause damage","zh":"造成损害"}]},{"id":"U07-W21","lemma":"metaphorical","surface":"metaphorical","pos":"adj.","zh":"隐喻的; 比喻的","sent":"U07-P3-S3","phrases":[{"en":"metaphorical meaning","zh":"隐喻意义"}]},{"id":"U07-W22","lemma":"absolutely","surface":"absolutely","pos":"adv.","zh":"绝对地; 完全地","sent":"U07-P3-S4","phrases":[{"en":"absolutely know","zh":"绝对知道"},{"en":"absolutely right","zh":"完全正确"}]},{"id":"U07-W23","lemma":"sort","surface":"sort","pos":"n. / v.","zh":"n. 种类; 类型 v. 分类; 整理","sent":"U07-P3-S5","phrases":[{"en":"some sort of","zh":"某种..."},{"en":"all sorts of","zh":"各种各样的"}]},{"id":"U07-W24","lemma":"instead of","surface":"instead of","pos":"phr.","zh":"而不是; 代替","sent":"U07-P3-S5","phrases":[{"en":"instead of doing sth.","zh":"而不是做某事"}]},{"id":"U07-W25","lemma":"stare","surface":"stare","pos":"v.","zh":"盯着看; 凝视","sent":"U07-P3-S5","phrases":[{"en":"stare at","zh":"盯着..."},{"en":"stare in wonder","zh":"惊奇地凝视"}]},{"id":"U07-W26","lemma":"unreasonable","surface":"unreasonable","pos":"adj.","zh":"不合理的; 不讲道理的","sent":"U07-P4-S1","phrases":[{"en":"unreasonable fear","zh":"不合理的恐惧"}]},{"id":"U07-W27","lemma":"bottom line","surface":"bottom line","pos":"phr.","zh":"底线; 最终结果","sent":"U07-P4-S2","phrases":[{"en":"the bottom line is","zh":"底线是..."}]},{"id":"U07-W28","lemma":"repeatedly","surface":"repeatedly","pos":"adv.","zh":"反复地; 重复地","sent":"U07-P4-S3","phrases":[{"en":"repeatedly say","zh":"反复说"}]},{"id":"U07-W29","lemma":"hesitate","surface":"hesitate","pos":"v.","zh":"犹豫; 迟疑","sent":"U07-P4-S4","phrases":[{"en":"hesitate to do sth.","zh":"犹豫做某事"},{"en":"without hesitation","zh":"毫不犹豫地"}]}],"_v":1786413566727}